{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 42, "timestamp": 1793028708, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/sh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "diffnote / real CLI on synthetic Git history"}
[0.935489, "o", "\r\n=== Tracked working tree ===\r\n$ diffnote --no-color\r\ndiffnote — reviewable PR draft\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  2 files changed (+2 / -1 text lines)\r\n  Suggested title: docs: update documentation\r\n  Title source: diff paths\r\n  Change source: tracked working tree\r\n  Changelog section: docs\r\n\r\n  Changes by area\r\n   docs       1\r\n   source     1\r\n\r\n  Highlights\r\n   • src/total.py [modified] +1 -1\r\n   • docs/guide.md [modified] +1 -0\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Offline heuristic draft. Tests were not run; review before sharing.\r\n\r\n\r\n=== Only the staged documentation ===\r\n$ diffnote --staged --no-color\r\ndiffnote — reviewable PR draft\r\n────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.935889, "o", "────────────────\r\n  1 files changed (+1 / -0 text lines)\r\n  Suggested title: docs: update documentation\r\n  Title source: diff paths\r\n  Change source: staged changes\r\n  Changelog section: docs\r\n\r\n  Changes by area\r\n   docs       1\r\n\r\n  Highlights\r\n   • docs/guide.md [modified] +1 -0\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Offline heuristic draft. Tests were not run; review before sharing.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.400859, "o", "\r\n=== Empty, binary, rename and mode facts ===\r\n$ diffnote --staged --no-color\r\ndiffnote — reviewable PR draft\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  4 files changed (+0 / -0 text lines)\r\n  Suggested title: docs: update documentation\r\n  Title source: diff paths\r\n  Change source: staged changes\r\n  Changelog section: docs\r\n\r\n  Changes by area\r\n   docs       2\r\n   source     2\r\n\r\n  Highlights\r\n   • data/empty.txt [added] +0 -0 mode — → 100644\r\n   • data/icon.bin [modified] binary; line counts unavailable\r\n   • docs/legacy.md → docs/usage.md [renamed] +0 -0\r\n   • src/total.py [modified] +0 -0 mode 100644 → 100755\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Offline heuristic draft. Tests were not run; review before sharing.\r\n\r\n"]
[2.199727, "o", "\r\n=== Signals have rule and path evidence ===\r\n$ diffnote --staged --no-color\r\ndiffnote — reviewable PR draft\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  2 files changed (+2 / -1 text lines)\r\n  Suggested title: chore: review database schema changes\r\n  Title source: diff paths\r\n  Change source: staged changes\r\n  Changelog section: chore\r\n\r\n  Review signals (heuristics, not safety findings)\r\n   • auth / security related\r\n       auth/session.py [auth-path; path]\r\n       auth/session.py [security-keyword; deleted]\r\n   • database migration / schema change\r\n       db/migrations/001_widgets.sql [migration-path; path]\r\n       db/migrations/001_widgets.sql [schema-keyword; added]\r\n\r\n  Changes by area\r\n   migration  1\r\n   source     1\r\n\r\n  Highlights\r\n   • auth/session.py [modified] +1 -1\r\n   • db/migrations/001_widgets.sql [added] +1 -0 mode — → 100644\r\n────────────"]
[2.199814, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Offline heuristic draft. Tests were not run; review before sharing.\r\n\r\n"]
[2.200006, "o", "\r\n=== JSON facts for local tooling ===\r\n$ diffnote --staged --json  # metadata scenario\r\n{\r\n  \"source\": \"staged changes\",\r\n  \"files\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"path\": \"data/empty.txt\",\r\n      \"old_path\": null,\r\n      \"new_path\": \"data/empty.txt\",\r\n      \"status\": \"added\",\r\n      \"added\": 0,\r\n      \"deleted\": 0,\r\n      \"binary\": false,\r\n      \"old_mode\": null,\r\n      \"new_mode\": \"100644\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"path\": \"data/icon.bin\",\r\n      \"old_path\": \"data/icon.bin\",\r\n      \"new_path\": \"data/icon.bin\",\r\n      \"status\": \"modified\",\r\n      \"added\": null,\r\n      \"deleted\": null,\r\n      \"binary\": true,\r\n      \"old_mode\": \"100644\",\r\n      \"new_mode\": \"100644\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"path\": \"docs/usage.md\",\r\n      \"old_path\": \"docs/legacy.md\",\r\n      \"new_path\": \"docs/usage.md\",\r\n      \"status\": \"renamed\",\r\n      \"added\": 0,\r\n      \"deleted\": 0,\r\n      \"binary\": false,\r\n      \"old_mode\": null,\r\n      \"new_mode\": null\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"path\": \"src/total.py\",\r\n      \"old_path\": \"src/total.py\",\r\n      \"new_path\": \"src/tot"]
[2.200063, "o", "al.py\",\r\n      \"status\": \"modified\",\r\n      \"added\": 0,\r\n      \"deleted\": 0,\r\n      \"binary\": false,\r\n      \"old_mode\": \"100644\",\r\n      \"new_mode\": \"100755\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"limits\": [\r\n    \"Heuristic draft; semantic correctness is unverified.\",\r\n    \"Tests were not run. Absence of signals is not evidence of safety.\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\r\n"]
[2.311965, "o", "\r\n=== Configured Git filters are rejected ===\r\n$ diffnote --no-color\r\ndiffnote: repositories with clean/process filters are unsupported; no filter programs will run\r\nExpected exit: 2. Helper marker absent.\r\n\r\n"]
